WEBVTT

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.000
<i>I stand in secret silence</i>

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.160
KARAOKE

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.290
<i>I scream into the darkness!</i>

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:19.580
<i>But the pain never ends!</i>

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.330
<i>Your time is up in ten minutes.</i>
<i>Would you like to extend it?</i>

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.540
Ah, I'm done.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:36.910
<i>These karaoke rooms are my sanctuary.</i>

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>A place of tranquility</i>
<i>on my way home from work.</i>

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.450
We await your next visit.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.370
<i>I can never let anyone see it...</i>

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>My secret place.</i>

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.830
RAGE

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.160
Protein!

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:40.200
Okay!
That's it for today's yoga class!

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:41.160
Protein!

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.450
Let's work up a good
sweat again next week!

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.620
Oww...

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:51.120
Sore muscles? It's quite hard
if you're not used to it.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.830
Yeah, I guess...

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.870
I won't put on excess muscle
from training here, will I?

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.660
What do you mean?

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.540
Well, that instructor leaves
yoga to his assistant,

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.450
and all he does is muscle building.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.790
He keeps saying "protein".

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:13.450
No matter how you look at it,
he's a yoga instructor in name only.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:14.830
So...

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:17.830
"Meat head."
Is that what you want to say?

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.620
No, no! I didn't mean that!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.580
Retsuko, he may not look it, but...

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:27.910
he's an amazing person who went
through strict training in India.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.000
Protein!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.450
Here's the proof!

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:36.410
Since I've been coming here,
my upper arms have become so defined.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.000
Look!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.370
That's not reassuring!

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.040
Why do you come to yoga, Retsuko?

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:48.290
Uh, well... You see...

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:51.120
It's because you want
to be beautiful, right?

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:55.040
Yes, well, something like that.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:01.540
<i>I can't say it's to help me find </i>
<i>a marriage partner so I can quit.</i>

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.830
What now?
Want to go for dinner?

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:09.120
Sounds nice! How about
that restaurant we've been to before?

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.950
The one with the yummy quiche.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.200
I'm tired of that place.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.000
Grilled meat, then.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.330
I'll get fat.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.160
You're coming, right?

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:21.700
Okay? Let's go!
There's so much I want to hear about.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.080
I'm sorry.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.000
I'm going home.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.200
I have some leftovers
in my fridge that I need to use.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:38.370
Oh dear... I see...

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.330
Protein...

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:58.450
Retsuko... it seems
that she's ignoring us.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.870
Maybe.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.500
She's refused to go out with us
three times already.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.540
It's got me down...

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:07.790
Think about how I feel
having to accompany you

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.120
every time you go to drown your sorrows.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.750
What's keeping Retsuko so busy?

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.660
Not some man, right?

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:17.620
Probably not.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:20.910
Did Retsuko tell you that?

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:26.330
She doesn't talk a lot about herself.
And I don't ask.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.450
So, you're just guessing?

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.500
An educated guess.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.160
Huh?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.120
STARTING MY YOGA CLASS

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.200
Who is that?

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.200
It's a picture that someone
took in their yoga class.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:43.450
Don't you think the person in
the background looks like Retsuko?

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:46.660
What are you saying?

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:50.450
Retsuko normally goes
straight to the station after work.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:54.540
But twice a week,
she heads in the opposite direction.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:57.040
She's going somewhere
near the office.

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.290
It's twice a week so it's
probably some kind of lesson.

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:04.660
She's been feeling sore lately,
so it must be something physical.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:09.250
Since she's not the gym type,
I guessed it was either Pilates or yoga,

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:13.040
and when I searched,
I found this photo.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.290
You're scary.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.120
I wouldn't want to be your enemy.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:20.410
It had to be done.
Retsuko wasn't going to tell us.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:32.250
<i>They were kind to invite me, </i>
<i>but I turned them down.</i>

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.910
<i>I'm glad that I became</i>
<i>acquaintances with them, but...</i>

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.370
<i>They're people from</i>
<i>the office, after all.</i>

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:42.580
<i>It could be awkward</i>
<i>being asked some questions.</i>

00:05:59.040 --> 00:05:59.950
I can't do it.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.660
I'll do it!

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:06.830
It's tight! I really can't open it!

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.750
"Tsubone's unopenable jars."

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.790
So she still hasn't opened it?

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.250
My goodness...

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.950
Retsuko, perfect timing.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:23.910
Could you open this jar for me?

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.000
Mind you, it's really tightly sealed.

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.620
I'm sure a go-getter
like you would be able to....

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.160
Ah!
I opened it.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:43.620
Retsuko, you're really something!

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:45.160
Huh? Why?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:49.330
You were like King Arthur back there.
Have you taken up body building?

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.450
What?

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:54.290
That's strange. It was
definitely a photo from a yoga class.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:57.580
-Is something wrong?
-No, just thinking out loud.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.500
<i>Are they angry that</i>
<i>I turned them down the other day?</i>

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.660
<i>Next time I see them,</i>
<i>I'll apologize.</i>

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:30.120
I wonder if Retsuko really
does hate us after all!

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.870
She just declined once!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:36.080
Let's try inviting her again next time.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.410
Protein...

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:17.750
Protein!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.660
That's all for today's yoga class!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.950
Protein!

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.580
Let's work up a good
sweat again next week!

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.370
Instructor...

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.120
Another good class today.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:35.950
Protein...

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:40.410
Ah, yes.
Thank you very much.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.080
Protein.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:54.410
Retsuko!
Let's go to the station together.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.750
Huh? You're not
stopping anywhere today?

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.540
Right! Today we're just going home!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:06.450
I'm sorry about the other day,
turning down your invitation...

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:10.700
That's okay! Water under the bridge.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.870
Retsuko, what line do you take?

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.830
Oh, the Den-en-toshi line.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.250
Which line do you two take?

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.750
KARAOKE
RECEPTION 2ND FLOOR

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:30.040
I haven't done karaoke in ages!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.080
What?

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.910
Neither have I!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:33.870
What?!

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:37.200
Washimi, do you feel
like singing, by any chance?

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:38.290
Yeah...

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.950
But, Gori, we were going home, remember?

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:46.160
What do you say...
Shall we check it out and decide?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.500
Let's just take a look.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.580
Hey! Wait!

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.910
Welcome. Party of one...

00:09:57.580 --> 00:09:59.540
A room for three.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:03.370
I thought you said you were
just going home today?!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.750
It's been too long!

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.120
This is rather nice.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.910
Do you do karaoke often, Retsuko?

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:18.040
No... Not much...

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.200
Why don't we order
some drinks for now?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.750
Who wants a beer?

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.160
I do!

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.450
<i>I can't be drawn into their trap.</i>

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:30.580
Uh, I'll have Oolong tea.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.450
Two beers and a cup of tea. Copy that!

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:36.580
<i>Front desk.</i>

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:39.790
Two beers and an Oolong cocktail, please.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.040
<i>She's spiking the tea with alcohol!</i>

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.250
There's no need to be so nervous.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.040
Outside work, there's no office hierarchy.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.660
We're all women.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:57.200
Because we're... yoga buddies!

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:00.160
Yoga buddies?

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.950
Friends on a journey of self-discovery,
opening chakras,

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:09.910
and becoming one with the universe
together! That's yoga buddies!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.500
I don't think it's that big a deal!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:15.080
Free your mind!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.580
Anyway...

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.410
Do you want to sing?

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:19.950
Yay!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:26.910
I wonder what Retsuko's going
to sing for us. I'm really curious.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.750
Some old-school hip-hop?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.410
Or some J-pop?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.330
Oh, I'm into death metal.

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:35.830
<i>I can't say that!</i>

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:38.120
<i>I have to get through this somehow.</i>

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:42.790
I don't have much of a repertoire.

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.000
I only know the chorus of this song.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:48.500
Oh, I'm wasting our time.
You two please sing first.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.870
We have three hours,
take your time and choose.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:52.830
<i>I've been dragged into a long battle!</i>

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.580
I've brought your beer
and the Oolong cocktail.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:01.750
I can't do this one...
This one's too teenage...

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.370
This is out of my range.
This one is depressing.

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.410
She's a tough one.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:09.290
Probably the type of girl
who is always on her toes.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.660
Don't worry.
The instructor told me.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.200
Protein...

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.750
This note will guide
us to the right answer.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.040
What is that number?

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:22.540
I don't know...

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:27.750
I wonder what the instructor
 is trying to tell us.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.450
Protein!

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:43.660
What should I do?
Which one to sing? What do I do?

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:48.620
Retsuko...
That's enough. Give it to me.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.000
SEND

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:10.250
<i>These karaoke rooms</i>
<i>are my sanctuary...</i>

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.410
REQUEST RECEIVED

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:16.870
<i>where I can be my true self.</i>

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:22.330
<i>That's why...</i>
<i>I have to keep it a secret.</i>

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:27.080
<i>That's what I've always believed.</i>

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.500
<i>This is all I ever sing! This is my soul!</i>

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:48.080
<i>All death metal 'cause it makes me whole!</i>

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:50.660
<i>Death!</i>

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:52.950
<i>Metal!</i>

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:57.080
<i>Death metal forever!</i>

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.200
You'll hurt your throat doing it that way.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.160
Clench your vocal chords, and...

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.660
Again, how do you
"clench" the vocal chords?!

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.410
I don't understand at all...

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.410
<i>Your time is up in ten minutes.</i>

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:41.040
Extend it, please!

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.120
Subtitle translation: John Haguewood
